'''Kintan striders''' were a [[species]]<ref name="AEYNTK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> of silicon-based lifeforms<ref name="Ewoks" /> from the [[planet]] [[Kintan]]<ref name="USW" /> who were intelligent enough to use simple tools.<ref name="Ewoks" /> Their appearance was used for one of the [[Hologram|holographic]] pieces in the game [[dejarik]].<ref name="AEYNTK" /> [[Tasu Leech]], [[topboss]] of the criminal [[Kanjiklub]] gang, owned a [[Donderbus blaster pistol]] whose handle was made from the [[Bone|ulna]] of a Kintan strider.<ref name="TFAVD">''[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> They were the namesake of the [[Kintan Striders Gang]], a gang of [[Nikto]]s active on [[Tatooine]] in the early [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|kintan-striders-gang|Kintan Striders Gang}}</ref>

